<title>BELGIUM: EU clears British Gas/Group 4 venture - EU source.</title>
<headline>EU clears British Gas/Group 4 venture - EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared a proposed joint venture between British Gas Trading Plc and Group 4 Utility Services Ltd to supply meter reading services in Britain, a European Union source said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
